    "forward_direction": "A carrier supplies K, its triangle, its exact period-root subsystem, and all negative curves; the finite exhaustion therefore places it in one compiler row.",
    "reverse_direction": "A blowup template constructs the deformation type; the nonempty exact character stratum and lifted Weyl chamber construct the requested nodal branch; exhaustive nonnegative wall sums prove equality with C_D++, so Friedman/GHK give an actual marked pair whose full nef cone is P.",
    "scope_warning": "Failure is a triangular-Looijenga carrier obstruction, never by itself an abstract hyperbolic-polytope nonexistence theorem.  This is a total detector for the chosen carrier species, not U_total asserting that every raw P has a carrier, and it transfers no dimension bound or polytope no-go theorem.",
    "statement": "A raw wall system P in C_triangle(4,8) has a marked rational full-nef Looijenga-pair carrier with an anticanonical triangle iff the adjunction canonical gate and the finite decoration/period/C_D++ compiler are nonempty. Equivalently in this census, its integral weighted Gram system is one of T6a,T6b,T7,T8."
  },
